      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Portable visual excerpt at 4 GB: native app uses TRACKBAR input in 512 MiB steps, an expanding range and exact MiB fields. The static HTML readout/preset selection does not implement synchronization, persistence or native GDI+ paint.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-ram\"><div class=\"ds-ram-heading\"><label for=\"ds-ram-range\">RAM máxima · passos de 0,5 GB</label><output for=\"ds-ram-range\">4 GB</output></div><input id=\"ds-ram-range\" class=\"ds-ram-range\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"16\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"4\" aria-label=\"RAM máxima em GB\" aria-describedby=\"ds-ram-help\"><div class=\"ds-ram-limits\"><span>0,5 GB</span><span>16 GB</span></div><div class=\"ds-ram-presets\"><button class=\"ds-ram-preset ds-ram-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\">4 GB</button><button class=\"ds-ram-preset\" aria-pressed=\"false\">6 GB</button><button class=\"ds-ram-preset\" aria-pressed=\"false\">8 GB</button></div><p id=\"ds-ram-help\">1 GB = 1024 MiB. Salve para aplicar.</p></section>",
